<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tribune strong buy repeated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tribune strong buy repeated.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Prudential Securities Inc said Monday it reiterated a strong buy rating on Tribune Co and called it &quot;our single best idea&quot; in a report.</p>
<p>--Analyst Melissa Cook said she was maintaining &quot;for now&quot; her $2.00 1997 earnings estimate on the media and entertainment company. Her 12-month price target on the stock is $57.</p>
<p>--Tribune ended off 1/4 at 41-5/8.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
